# 29. IMPORTANT PRODUCT DESIGN PRINCIPLES

These principles must guide the entire development process.

### 1. One central business record

A business should have one unified record throughout the application.

Discovery, research, campaigns, follow-ups and opportunities must connect to it.

### 2. Research before outreach

The application must understand a business before generating a personalised sales message.

### 3. Evidence before assumptions

The AI must distinguish verified information, reasonable inference and unavailable information.

### 4. Relationship-building over mass messaging

The system should help AdVibe build valuable business relationships, not simply generate large volumes of generic emails.

### 5. Follow-up is a first-class feature

No prospect should become invisible simply because the initial email has been sent.

The platform should always make the next planned action visible.

### 6. Human approval for important external actions

AI can research, recommend and draft. The user remains in control of prospecting emails and important commercial decisions.

### 7. Configurable business information

Services, packages, prices, markets, targets and campaign templates must be editable from the administration area.

### 8. Modular integrations

Gmail and SendFox must be separate providers within a common integration architecture.

### 9. Accurate analytics

The system must report only events it can actually observe.

### 10. Background processing

Discovery, research, synchronisation and scheduled tasks must continue independently of the user's browser session.

