# 30. FINAL PRODUCT DEFINITION

AdVibe Prospect Intelligence should become the central business development platform for AdVibe Studios.

It should continuously discover potential customers, research their businesses, identify their marketing opportunities, recommend the most relevant AdVibe services, organise prospects into a structured CRM, prepare personalised outreach, create Gmail drafts, measure engagement and manage every follow-up.

The most important outcome is not the number of businesses in the database.

It is the number of meaningful business relationships the platform helps AdVibe create and convert.

**The desired operating cycle is:**

DISCOVER → RESEARCH → QUALIFY → PRIORITISE → CONTACT → TRACK → FOLLOW UP → BUILD RELATIONSHIPS → CONVERT → RETAIN.

Every major feature should contribute to this cycle.